# [CFRG](../wg/cfrg.html)

## Summary

The Crypto Forum Research Group (CFRG) met at IETF 127. The session covered working group document status updates, followed by three research presentation topics:
1. Standardization updates and formal verification for Sigma protocols and the Fiat-Shamir transformation.
2. Performance optimizations and formal proof updates for the Longfellow zero-knowledge argument system.
3. A Schnorr-type zero-knowledge proof of possession mechanism for ECDSA device binding in privacy-preserving credentials.

